cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."

title: "ZX Federated IoT Platform"
type: software
version: "1.0.0-m1"
license: "MIT"

abstract: >-
  ZX Federated IoT Platform is a local, Docker-based simulation system
  for power-load prediction and alarm analysis. It provides a
  PostgreSQL-backed workflow covering CSV intake, preprocessing,
  immutable parameter snapshots, queued execution, three-agent
  simulation, prediction intervals, fused diagnostics, alarm analysis,
  history replay, and result export.

authors:
